<title>UK: Socgen sets $220 mln perpetual FRN, call.</title>
<headline>Socgen sets $220 mln perpetual FRN, call.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following floating-rate issue was announced by lead manager Morgan Stanley International.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SOCIETE GENERALE</p>
<p> AMT    $220 MLN	SPREAD     +62.5 BP  MATURITY    PERPETUAL</p>
<p> TYPE	 FRN	 BASE	 3M LIBOR  PAY DATE    15.OCT.96</p>
<p> LAST MOODY AA3	 ISS PRICE  99.74     FULL FEES   =</p>
<p> LAST S&amp;P   A-	  REOFFER    99.74</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX	 DENOMS (K) 100	 SALE LIMITS US/UK/FR</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  GOV LAW    ENGLISH</p>
<p> MGT/UND    60 BP     SELL CONC  15 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	PAR CALL FROM 15.OCT.06 AND EACH PAYMENT DATE</p>
<p>		THERAFTER</p>
<p>		SOCIETE GENERALE IS THE OTHER LEAD MANAGER</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
